BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Betrayal
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T213000
DTSTAMP:20261023T114720Z
UID:funcheap-1637555@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMarin TheatreBy Harold Pinter\
 nDirected by Carey Perloff\nThe end is the beginning. Moving backwards and
  forwards\, Betrayal illuminates a seven-year affair between Emma and Jerr
 y\, her husband Robert’s closest friend. As the story unravels\, the ten
 sion between memory and reality is sharpened\, revealing shifting perspect
 ives\, hidden motives\, unspoken power dynamics\, and titillating pleasure
  behind the deception. Laced with Pinter’s signature wit\, this piercing
  drama is a masterclass in what is said — and unsaid — between lovers 
 and friends. Words and silences punctuate the irreversible consequences of
  long-concealed truths and betrayals which reverberate far beyond a single
  act. After helming hit Marin Theatre productions of The Cherry Orchard an
 d Waste\, A.C.T. Artistic Director Emerita Carey Perloff returns to Marin 
 Theatre to direct.\n\n$39.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/159
 825/t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/betrayal/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
