 shot-2026-09-18-200839.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T114720Z
LOCATION:Marin Theatre\, 397 Miller Avenue Mill Valley\, CA 94941-2885
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/betrayal/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GREEN FILM FESTIVAL: Bodyhackers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T223000
DTSTAMP:20261023T050002Z
UID:dothebay-17947933@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Green Film Festival presents:\n\nBODYHACKERS\n\nCronenbergian 
 body horror is deployed to darkly satirical ends in Carlos Conceição's E
 nglish-language debut\, the noir-inflected story of an anti-corporate acti
 vist who becomes involved in a cult-like underworld of black-market plasti
 c surgery.\n\nEnvironmental activist Denver Blake has resolved to expose a
  cosmetics corporation he believes is exploiting the insecurities bred by 
 society's beauty standards. But when he falls in love with Renée — a fo
 rmer ballerina obsessed with perpetually perfecting her beauty — he is d
 rawn into a mesmerizing underworld of plastic surgery\, where the pursuit 
 of the flawless body becomes its own kind of horror.\n\nCo-presented by An
 other Hole in the Head.\n\nForget the guilt trip\, the Green Film Festival
  of San Francisco\, the mischievous\, tree-hugging cousin of the 29 year o
 ld SF IndieFest\, returns Oct 15-22 to prove that saving the planet doesn'
 t have to feel like homework. We've ditched the doom-and-gloom documentari
 es that make you want to crawl under a (sustainably sourced) blanket and n
 ever come out. The line-up this year pairs sharp environmental storytellin
 g with wit\, weirdness\, and unapologetic irreverence. And yes\, our Eco-H
 orror midnight movie is back!\n\nWhether you’re an eco-curious cinephile
  or a die-hard activist\, come join in the fun because if we're going to t
 alk about the end of the world as we know it\, we might as well laugh\, ga
 sp\, and maybe even dance a little on the way there. Through this...\n\nDe
 tails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/green-film-festival-bodyhack
 ers-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34917128/8f4c7c70-1317-4c07-877a-dade2a388d98.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T050002Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/green-film-festival-bodyhackers
 -tickets
END:VEVENT
