DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSF’s Wild New Britney Spears
  Musical “Once Upon a One More Time” (Oct. 23-Nov. 11)Powered entirely
  by the iconic hits of Britney Spears\, Once Upon a One More Time is a daz
 zling\, pop-fueled musical that flips classic fairy tales on their heads. 
 When Cinderella begins to question her storybook destiny\, she discovers a
  magical book that introduces her— and the rest of the princesses—to m
 odern ideas about independence\, choice\, and rewriting your own narrative
 .\n\nOnce Upon a One More Time is a hilarious\, high-energy musical packed
  with Britney Spears’ biggest hits\, explosive choreography\, outrageous
  costumes\, and 23 powerhouse performers.\n\nAs Snow White\, Sleeping Beau
 ty\, Little Mermaid\, and more begin to challenge their traditional roles\
 , the land of fairy tales erupts into a joyful revolution set to chart-top
 ping anthems like …\nBaby One More Time\, Toxic\, Stronger\, and Oops!
 … I Did It Again. What unfolds is a high-energy celebration of self-empo
 werment\, friendship\, and the courage to take control of your own story.\
 nBold\, funny\, and irresistibly fun\, Once Upon a One More Time is a glit
 tering spectacle that blends nostalgia with modern feminism\, proving that
  princes are optional-but owning your power is not. Get ready to dance\, s
 ing along\, and see fairy tales through a totally new lens.\n\nUpcoming SF
 ’s Wild New Britney Spears Musical “Once Upon a One More Time” (Oct.
  23-Nov. 11) Events\nFri 10/30 SF’s Wild New Britney Spears Musical “O
 nce Upon a One More...\n\n$41.00\n\nTickets: https://www.rayoflighttheatre
 .com/britney\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-wild-britney-spears-mus
 ical-time-oct-24nov-11/\nSource: Funcheap SF
