 232_18562872409076431_722015364464872399_n.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T000148Z
LOCATION:Stockmen’s Park\, N. Livermore Avenue and Railroad Avenue\, Liv
 ermore
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/the-great-elephant-migration-27-elephant-sculp
 tures-take-over-livermor-oct-10-dec-6/
