DESCRIPTION:$10 Off Tix: SF’s “Terror Vault” 1874 Halloween Haunt is
  Back for 2026 (Oct. 1-Nov. 1)\nTerror Vault\nSan Francisco’s premiere h
 aunted attraction returns for 2026 with “SLASHED: Return to Hellville”
  an all-new\, bigger\, and more terrifying theatrical and immersive experi
 ence from the insane mind of Peaches Christ.\nBrand new for 2026: Thirty-s
 even years after the infamous Hellville massacre\, a terrifying new evil h
 as awakened. Step inside Terror Vault’s most ambitious immersive horror 
 experience yet as you become trapped inside a living 1980s slasher movie. 
 Journey through abandoned schools\, haunted campgrounds\, blood-soaked fra
 ternity houses\, forgotten video stores\, and other iconic horror location
 s while confronting a masked killer\, vengeful ghosts\, and the terrifying
  legacy of Dr. Grieves’ Fear Engine. Featuring Hollywood-caliber sets\, 
 cinematic storytelling\, live actors\, and pulse-pounding scares\, SLASHED
 : Return to Hellville is more than a haunted attraction. It’s a fully im
 mersive horror adventure where every room is another scene\, every shadow 
 hides a killer\, and every decision you make brings you closer to uncoveri
 ng the mystery… or becoming its next victim. Enter Hellville. Escape if 
 you can.\nThis goes waaay beyond just some regular haunted house. This is 
 an hour-long immersive and theatrical experience which spans 3 floors of t
 he building w/ 29 fully developed immersive sets and over 100 scare actors
  each night at the historic 1874 San Francisco Mint.\n\n“Terror Vault”
  Ha...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.terrorvault.com/\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/10-off-tix-sfs-terror-vault-1874-halloween-haunt-2026-4/\n
 Source: Funcheap SF
