SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMz. KEULOGY IIII – A Maynard
  Inspired Cabaret of Shadow & Ceremony\n\nDearly beloved… we gather once
  more.\nAs the veil thins and the nights grow longer\, FVT invites you int
 o a chapel of shadow and spectacle for EULOGY IIII\, our 4th annual cabare
 t honoring the music and mystique of Maynard James Keenan.\nThis is no ord
 inary tribute. It’s a living ritual of recognition\, transformation\, an
 d release. Through pole\, burlesque\, circus\, and sideshow\, our artists 
 summon the essence of Maynard ~ Tool\, A Perfect Circle\, Puscifer\, and m
 ore ~ in an evening where performance becomes ceremony.\n\nStep into the s
 hadows and experience an entertaining evening of ritual\, spectacle\, and 
 celebration ~ all through the lens of Maynard.\n\n$35.00\n\nTickets: https
 ://www.fluxtheatreberkeley.org/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/eulogy-4
 /\nSource: Funcheap SF
