 4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T163045Z
LOCATION:Flux Vertical Theatre\, 811 University Avenue Berkeley\, CA 94710
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/eulogy-4/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LIVE MUSIC: Resavoir
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T220000
DTSTAMP:20261026T131406Z
UID:dothebay-17578419@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Throwin’ Bo’s presents:\n\nResavoir\n\nResavoir is the wor
 k of Chicago-born and based musician\, composer and producer Will Miller.\
 n\nMiller is a jazz trumpeter and composer by training – first via Chica
 go Public Schools\, then Oberlin Conservatory. As an instrumentalist he’
 s played on recordings by Chance The Rapper\, Lil Wayne\, Mac Miller\, and
  for several years was a regular member of the indie band Whitney. But sin
 ce 2016 he has been moving more and more in the direction of all around 
 “producer” – working with an expanded palette of synths\, pianos\, l
 ive and programmed drums in addition to his MIDI-augmented trumpet\, he ha
 s developed a signature cinematic soul-jazz sound rooted in hip-hop struct
 ures\, heard through his work on tracks for Eryn Allen Kane\, Whitney\, Kn
 ox Fortune\, and SZA’s recently-released album SOS (which spent 10 weeks
  as the #1 spot on the Billboard 200 chart).\n\nIn 2019 Miller released Re
 savoir’s debut album Resavoir to high praise\, including a glowing 8.2 r
 eview in Pitchfork. Later that year\, Miller and his live version of the R
 esavoir band (featuring former Noname musical director Akenya\, saxophonis
 t/vocalist/MC Sen Morimoto\, and others) did their London debut as part of
  the first Boiler Room Festival. While they were in London\, they did a re
 cording session at Total Refreshment Studios. One of those recordings was 
 a cover of the Charles Tolliver song “Plight\,” and the track was rele
 ased by Blue Note Records as part of the compilation Transmissions from To
 tal Refr...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/live-music-
 resavoir-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funche
 ap.com/sfs-wild-big-gay-halloween-at-great-star-theater-october-11-25/
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33180814/a42aba60-5f47-416f-8cc9-d99ca73c9435.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261026T131406Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/live-music-resavoir-tickets
END:VEVENT
