UID:dothebay-17884743@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:When Jeffrey Franken's fiancée is chopped to pieces by the bl
 ades of a remote-controlled lawnmower\, he uses his dubious medical knowle
 dge to try to bring her back to life. He reassembles his beloved Elizabeth
  using the body parts of New York City's finest prostitutes\, and resurrec
 ts her during a heavy lightning storm. Unfortunately for Jeffrey\, his dea
 r Elizabeth's brain is scrambled and she runs amok on 42nd Street\, turnin
 g tricks and bringing high-voltage death to her customers!\n\nCamp Balboa 
 is a monthly series highlighting campy film classics that play with color\
 , humor\, queerness\, self-expression\, or all of the above. Sometimes acc
 ompanied with yummy snack pop-ups or drag shows!\n\nThis film can be used 
 with loyalty cards or our 2026 annual CinemaSFBay passes\n\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/frankenhooker-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\
 n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-wild-big-gay-halloween-a
 t-great-star-theater-october-11-25/
