 et/34958246/588636ca-d87e-44e7-8619-edaae55dd9d4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T090716Z
LOCATION:The Rueff at A.C.T.'s Strand Theater\, 1127 Market Street\, San F
 rancisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/26/bay-area-immersive-theater-make
 rs-gathering-performer-perspectives-tickets
END:VEVENT
