UID:dothebay-17955963@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, October 26\, 2026\, 6:30-11:30pm Pacific. Doors 6:30p
 m\; beginner salsa 7pm\; intermediate salsa 7:55pm\; dancing-only admissio
 n from 9pm.\n\nCelebrate Halloween at SalsaCrazy Mondays with salsa classe
 s and a salsa and bachata dance party at Neck of the Woods. Costumes are e
 ncouraged for both the lessons and the dance party. Come solo\, bring a da
 te or gather your friends for a welcoming Monday night on the dance floor.
 \n\nFor more than 20 years\, SalsaCrazy Mondays has helped San Francisco l
 earn to dance. The beginner lessons start with your very first steps: no p
 artner or experience needed. Partners rotate in class so everyone has some
 one to practice with\, and intermediate salsa offers returning dancers a c
 hance to build their moves. Class tickets include the lessons and dancing 
 afterward.\n\nMonday\, October 26\, 2026\, 6:30-11:30pm. Doors open at 6:3
 0pm\; beginning salsa starts at 7pm and intermediate salsa at 7:55pm. Stay
  for salsa and bachata social dancing after class. Dancing-only tickets ar
 e valid from 9pm. Arrive early for music and drinks and to avoid the line.
 \n\nNeck of the Woods is at 406 Clement Street at 5th Avenue\, San Francis
 co\, CA 94118\, in the Richmond District. Enjoy a full bar\, great sound a
 nd a lively crowd\, with neighborhood restaurants and cafes nearby. Free p
 arking is listed by the event organizer. Ages 21+ with valid ID. Wear comf
 ortable shoes that let you move and turn.\n\nCurrent tickets: lessons and 
 dancing are $38.18 early bird\, including a $3.18 fee\, or $40...\n\n$10-4
 0\, lessons and/or dancing\, subj to avail.\nSalsaCrazy\, Inc.\n\nDetails:
  https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/26/salsacrazy-mondays-halloween-salsa
 -classes-salsa-bachata-dancing-sf-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed
  on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/salsacrazy-mondays-halloween-salsa-classes
 -salsa-bachata-dancing-sf/
