DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerRob LewisYou are invited to a 
 one-of-a-kind theater experience: be a part of a one-day play performance!
  Mission StageWorks welcomes you to experience the joy of acting and playi
 ng onstage. Here’s your chance to connect in a radically inclusive space
 . Never been on stage? Getting back into acting? Just like to perform? Per
 fect! This low pressure environment is designed to meet people\, create ch
 aracters\, play during rehearsal\, and present short staged-reading perfor
 mances with a short-term theater ensemble.\nCome for the love of theater. 
 Leave with found company.\nFree food and beverages.\nGet tickets\nMission 
 StageWorks offers tickets on a sliding scale. At this event\, you have the
  following options:\n\nPay It Forward = $40\nStandard Rate = $30\nIntroduc
 tory Rate = $20\nBring a Friend promo = $20\, two tickets for the price of
  one\n\nMission StageWorks is committed to making our events accessible to
  our entire community. If our current sliding scale tiers do not fit your 
 budget\, please contact us at info@missionstageworks.org\n\n$20.00\n\nTick
 ets: https://www.missionstageworks.org/events/foundcompany4\nDetails: http
 s://sf.funcheap.com/company-spontaneous-staged-reading/\nSource: Funcheap 
 SF
