BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:China Moves
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T220000
DTSTAMP:20261029T100747Z
UID:dothebay-17882110@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:Identity and heritage converge as Chinese artists from around 
 the world bring their stories to the screen.\n\nChina Moves presents dance
  films by filmmakers working inside China alongside those creating from af
 ar. Eight films explore story\, memory\, and transformation across generat
 ions and geographies. Several works reclaim ritual and rework heritage int
 o something lived-in rather than performed. Others examine the experience 
 of moving between cultures: the disorientation\, the negotiation\, the qui
 et acts of self-making. Together\, these films offer a wide-ranging portra
 it of what it means to belong\, to remember\, and to become.\n\nFollowed b
 y a live Q&A with artists moderated by Wei Wang.\n\n2026 SF Dance Film Fes
 tival:\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/28/china-moves-tick
 ets\nSource: DoTheBay
