DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerPachuquísmo by La Mezcla is a
  multi-disciplinary\, rhythmic performance that unveils a forgotten histor
 y of Mexican-American female youth and explores the struggles that communi
 ties of color continue to face today. With the 9-person\, all-womxn cast d
 onning full zoot suits\, Pachuquísmo pulls the narrative of the Zoot Suit
  Riots out of the male-centered context and portrays the experiences of la
 s pachucas of the 1940’s through movement\, spoken word and video.\n\n$2
