SUMMARY:Otter Lake with Emma Portner
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17882153@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:An intimate\, unguarded look at the creative process of one of
  dance’s most singular voices: Emma Portner.\n\nWORLD PREMIERE | Otter L
 ake follows choreographer Emma Portner as she turns to movement to reconne
 ct with herself and confront her inner world. At just 31\, Portner has bec
 ome one of dance’s most distinctive voices\, creating work for the Natio
 nal Ballet of Canada\, the Norwegian National Ballet\, and musical artists
  ranging from Justin Bieber to FKA Twigs.\n\nThis documentary offers a rar
 e\, intimate look inside her creative process\, following Emma as she prod
 uces three new works\, including pieces for the Royal Swedish Ballet and G
 öteborgsOperans Danskompani. Through a deeply personal lens\, the film ca
 ptures her vulnerability and brilliance alongside an unexpected bond forme
 d during a transformative moment at her Otter Lake residence\, offering a 
 glimpse into the soul of an artist who communicates through movement when 
 words fall short.\n\nFollowed by a live Q&A with Emma Portner and director
  Katya Mokolo.\n\nInfo and tickets: https://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festi
 val-2026/otter-lake/\n\n20-40\n2026 SF Dance Film Festival:\n\nTickets: ht
 tps://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/otter-lake/\nDetails: https:/
 /dothebay.com/events/2026/10/30/otter-lake-with-emma-portner-tickets\nSour
 ce: DoTheBay
