 antly surprised at the professional level creative and production team\, a
 nd unmistakable theater magic that fills our intimate space when audiences
  witness young performers coming into their own on stage.\nWednesday Addam
 s\, the beloved princess of darkness\, has grown up and fallen in love wit
 h a sweet young man from a seemingly ordinary family. A man her parents ha
 ve never met.\n\nEverything will change for the whole family on the fatefu
 l night they host dinner for Wednesday’s boyfriend and his parents.\nFul
 l of quirky characters\, wicked humor\, catchy songs\, and plenty of heart
 \, this ghoulishly fun musical is a celebration of family\, love\, and emb
 racing what makes us different.\n\n$35.00\n\nTickets: https://www.throckmo
 rtontheatre.org/events/the-addams-family-musical\nDetails: https://sf.func
