CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Wild New Britney Spears Musical “Once Upon a One More
  Time” (Oct. 23-Nov. 11)\nTIFFANY DAVIS\nPowered entirely by the iconic 
 hits of Britney Spears\, Once Upon a One More Time is a dazzling\, pop-fue
 led musical that flips classic fairy tales on their heads. When Cinderella
  begins to question her storybook destiny\, she discovers a magical book t
 hat introduces her— and the rest of the princesses—to modern ideas abo
 ut independence\, choice\, and rewriting your own narrative.\n\nOnce Upon 
 a One More Time is a hilarious\, high-energy musical packed with Britney S
 pears’ biggest hits\, explosive choreography\, outrageous costumes\, and
  23 powerhouse performers.\n\nAs Snow White\, Sleeping Beauty\, Little Mer
 maid\, and more begin to challenge their traditional roles\, the land of f
 airy tales erupts into a joyful revolution set to chart-topping anthems li
 ke …\n\nBaby One More Time\, Toxic\, Stronger\, and Oops!… I Did It Ag
 ain. What unfolds is a high-energy celebration of self-empowerment\, frien
 dship\, and the courage to take control of your own story.\nBold\, funny\,
  and irresistibly fun\, Once Upon a One More Time is a glittering spectacl
 e that blends nostalgia with modern feminism\, proving that princes are op
 tional-but owning your power is not. Get ready to dance\, sing along\, and
  see fairy tales through a totally new lens.\n\nUpcoming SF’s Wild New B
 ritney Spears Musical “Once Upon a One More Time” (Oct. 23-Nov. 11) Ev
 ents\nFri 10/30 SF’s Wild New Britney Spears Musical “Once Upon a One 
 More Time” (Oct. 23-...\n\n$41.00\n\nTickets: https://www.rayoflightthea
 tre.com/britney\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-wild-new-britney-spe
 ars-musical-once-upon-a-one-more-time-oct-23-nov-11/\nSource: Funcheap SF
