BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PALESTINE CINEMA DAYS: Return to Haifa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261102T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261102T193000
DTSTAMP:20261026T203423Z
UID:dothebay-17989154@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Filmlab Palestine presents Palestine Cinema Days Around the Wo
 rld:\n\nRETURN TO HAIFA\n\nOn April 21\, 1948\, the quiet life in the Pale
 stinian city of Haifa turned into something resembling hell\, amid mortar 
 shelling\, and the people of Haifa were forced to leave their city and thu
 s emigrate from their homeland. A Palestinian family left their child\, Kh
 aldoun\, and immigrated without being able to reach home to carry him with
  them on their migration journey\, and their obsession with searching for 
 him remains for 20 years.\n\nThis screening is presented for free thanks t
 o Filmlab Palestine as part of Palestine Cinema Days Around the World:\n\n
 “Palestine Cinema Days Around the World is a global platform that transc
 ends borders to bring Palestinian stories to the forefront of the world’
 s conscience. A fragile ceasefire may quiet the headlines\, but it does no
 t stop the genocide. In Gaza\, death continues through siege\, starvation\
 , displacement\, and abandonment. As the world slowly looks away\, we are 
 reminded how easily Palestine can disappear from the news while its people
  continue to endure unimaginable loss. That is precisely why our stories m
 ust travel further and louder this year. At a time when silence is imposed
  on our existence\, and our grief is treated as background noise\, cinema 
 becomes more than art\; it becomes presence\, memory\, and resistance. Thr
 ough Palestine Cinema Days Around the World 2026\, we gather not only to s
 creen films but to affirm that the Palestinian narrative cannot...\n\nTick
 ets: https://www.4-star-movies.com/calendar-of-events/return-to-haifa\nDet
 ails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/2/palestine-cinema-days-return-t
 o-haifa-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35142043/a3d69c98-45da-4247-9179-86957d28d136.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261026T203423Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/2/palestine-cinema-days-return-to-
 haifa-tickets
END:VEVENT
