DESCRIPTION:War reduced Japan to zero\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus
 . Two years have passed since then\, and the country has faced agonizing s
 truggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life.\n\nJust a
 s humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace\, a new threat strikes\, c
 rushing hope in an instant.\n\nThere is no third time. Everything ends her
 e.\n\nSubtitled Screening\n\nThis film can be used with loyalty cards or o
