UID:dothebay-17636988@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:US Tour - 2 venues\n\nA dynamic celebration of the legendary s
 inger-songwriter’s greatest hits\, and the story of the man behind the m
 elodies.\n\nFrom the producers of The Simon and Garfunkel Story and The Li
 fe and Music of George Michael comes The Billy Joel Legacy: A Tribute Expe
 rience – A dynamic celebration of the legendary singer-songwriter’s gr
 eatest hits\, and the story of the man behind the melodies. This concert e
 xperience takes you on a journey through Billy’s legendary career\, from
  his humble beginnings to becoming one of the greatest songwriters and per
 formers of all time. Through faithful recreation of the original music\, s
 tunning visuals\, and compelling storytelling\, you’ll discover how his 
 music has shaped generations and why his legacy endures.\n\nFisher Theatre
 \n\nWed\, Oct 7\, 2026\n\nCurran Theatre\n\nThu\, Nov 5\, 2026\n\nTickets:
  https://us.atgtickets.com/events/billy-joel-legacy/\nDetails: https://dot
 hebay.com/events/2026/11/5/billy-joel-legacy-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
