SUMMARY:Bay Area Shorts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17882175@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:The grand finale to our 2026 San Francisco Dance Film Festival
 \, Bay Area Shorts is an annual tradition honoring the depth and range of 
 Northern California’s dance film community. This year’s dynamic progra
 m moves from the elemental to the surreal — a solo dancer answers the rh
 ythm of crashing waves\, a love story is told entirely through animation\,
  office workers mistake a mysterious map for a covert mission\, and much m
 ore. With choreography from acclaimed artists including Brenda Way (ODC/Da
 nce)\, Adji Cissoko (LINES Ballet)\, Natasha Adorlee (concept o4)\, plus a
  closing reception\, this evening is your chance to celebrate our homegrow
 n talent and send off the festival in style.\n\nBay Area Shorts includes t
 he world premiere of "Griot\," a film commissioned by Dance Film SF’s SI
 GHTLINE initiative. Griot stars LINES Ballet dancer Adji Cissoko with dire
 ction by Oakland-based filmmaker Yoram Savion\, both of whom will particip
 ate in a live Q&A.\n\nAll ticket holders are invited to attend a post-scre
 ening reception in the lobby to celebrate the end of the 2026 Festival.\n\
 nTickets and info: https://sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/bay-area
 -shorts-2026/\n\n$25-45\n2026 SF Dance Film Festival:\n\nTickets: https://
 sfdancefilmfest.org/fall-festival-2026/bay-area-shorts-2026\nDetails: http
 s://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/8/bay-area-shorts-tickets\nSource: DoTheBa
 y
GEO:37.7526148;-122.4078356
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34611311/12350ecf-2354-4781-86d0-f77db669085b.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Brava Theater\, 2781 24th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/8/bay-area-shorts-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LIVE MUSIC: Society of Rockets\, Amores Vigilantes\, Kitten on the
  Keys
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261108T220000
DTSTAMP:20261014T214646Z
UID:dothebay-17954114@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Society of Rockets\n\nPack your psychedelic psuitcase for a jo
 urney to the center of The Society of Rockets' latest brain-melting blowpo
 p confection: A Pocketful of Phables. The veteran San Francisco indie band
 's new double-LP is an 18-track wunderground soundseeing tour that starts 
 in orbit around the moon and spirals down through the woods\, past haunted
  houses and halls of mirrors\, all the way to the bottom of the sea. Inspi
 red by the lengthy lineage that stretches from the Beatles\, Syd Barrett\,
  and the Kinks through XTC\, Robyn Hitchcock\, and the Cleaners from Venus
 \, to the Lilys\, Guided by Voices\, and the Elephant 6 Recording Company\
 , the Rockets' 9th full-length release is stuffed with buzzing melodies\, 
 exploding rhythms and bewildering twists. Buckle up\, lay back\, and leave
  this world behind for a better one.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nAmores Vigilantes
 \n\nIf You Would’ve Ever Read This\, I’d Want You To Know— the new a
 lbum out in Spring of 2026 —is a collection of songs based on material t
 hat dates back to the inception of the band\, including elements taken fro
 m original Tascam 4-track cassette recordings when Amores Vigilantes forme
 d in a San Francisco Bay Area garage in the ‘90s.\n\nLike a love letter 
 nearly never opened\, If You Would’ve Ever Read This\, I’d Want You To
  Know finally reaches its audience with a songwriting message that transce
 nds time or trends.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nKitten on the Keys\n\nSan Francisc
 o Cabaret Performer: Piano\, Accordion\, Vocals\, Ukulele\n\nIG\n\nDOORS a
 t 7:00PM | M...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20
 202?siteToken=d2atbcege5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/ev
 ents/2026/11/8/live-music-society-of-rockets-amores-vigilantes-kitten-on-t
 he-keys-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34948651/95cf47cb-8fd8-446b-8790-aa16b020382c.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T214646Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/8/live-music-society-of-rockets-am
 ores-vigilantes-kitten-on-the-keys-tickets
END:VEVENT
