DESCRIPTION:$5 Off Tix: San Francisco Playhouse’s “Peter Pan Goes Wron
 g” (Sept. 26-Nov. 28)\nSan Francisco Playhouse\nBy Henry Lewis\, Henry S
 hields & Jonathan Sayer The Cornley Polytechnic Drama Society is back\, an
 d this time they’re taking on Peter Pan. Save $5 off tickets with code F
 UNCHEAP.\nIt’s their most ambitious production yet\, complete with flyin
 g rigs\, sword fights\, and a very real crocodile problem. What could poss
 ibly go wrong? As technical mishaps pile up and tempers flare\, the cast b
 attles to keep the show on track while everything around them spectacularl
 y falls apart. Lines are forgotten\, scenery refuses to cooperate\, and ri
 valries spill onto the stage in real time. From the creators of The Play T
 hat Goes Wrong\, this riotous comedy delivers nonstop mayhem\, perfectly t
 imed chaos\, and the kind of theatrical disaster you have to see to believ
 e.\nPeter Pan Goes Wrong\nSan Francisco Playhouse\nSeptember 26 – Novemb
 er 28\, 2026\n450 Post St.\, San Francisco\nTickets start at $55 – inclu
 ding limited orchestra tickets!\nExclusive – Get $5 off Tickets w/ secre
 t code FUNCHEAP\nThe best seats go quickly. Tickets are subject to availab
 ility. Promo code not valid for past purchases.\n“Expertly executed Broa
 dway mayhem!” – Variety\n“A great date night and fun for the family!
 ” – NY Daily News\nAbout the Creators\nHENRY LEWIS is an Olivier Award
  winning writer\, actor and producer and is the artistic director of Misch
 ief. Henry’s work has been produced in over 40 countries worldwide.\nHen
 ry’s recent credi...\n\n$55.00\n\nTickets: https://sfplayhouse.org/2026-
 2027-season/peter-pan-goes-wrong/?utm_source=funcheap&amp\;utm_medium=part
 ner&amp\;utm_campaign=ppgwfuncheap\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/5-off
 -tix-san-francisco-playhouses-peter-pan-goes-wrong-sept-26-nov-28-4/\nSour
 ce: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ppgw-r
 esponsive-wide.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Playhouse\, 450 Post St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/5-off-tix-san-francisco-playhouses-peter-pan-g
 oes-wrong-sept-26-nov-28-4/
