BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Francisco Underground Short Film Festival 2026: First Program
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T141500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T161500
DTSTAMP:20261014T214646Z
UID:dothebay-17954113@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:The San Francisco Underground Short Film Festival returns to t
 he Bay Area to celebrate locally-made cinematic mayhem!\n\nFounded by Peac
 hes Christ & Vinsantos in 2003 at the Bridge Theatre\, partially as a show
 case for their own short films that weren’t getting traction at “legit
 imate” festivals\, the SFUSFF ran under their care for six years until 2
 008. After Vinsantos moved to New Orleans\, Peaches and fellow film progra
 mmer Sam Sharkland wanted to see the fest continue and so revived it in 20
 11 at the Victoria Theatre where it ran until 2015. Now\, after 10 years\,
  the festival has found a new home at the 4 Star Theater under the care of
  Piranha Psychotronica and Kafka X\, the maniacal minds behind Media Meltd
 own Movie Madhouse.\n\nThe San Francisco Underground Short Film Festival e
 xists to celebrate local\, independent filmmaking. We proudly champion the
  overlooked and underrated\, the avant-garde and the alternative\, the out
 rageous\, the oddball\, and the outlandish. We'll be presenting the silly\
 , subversive\, surreal\, and strange from all Bay Area filmmakers! From bi
 zarro B-films to midnight movie trash\, expect the weirdest and wildest th
 e Bay has to offer\, with the night kicking off with our lighter fare and 
 getting darker and more freaky as the evening goes on. Cinematic weirdos -
  you have found the festival for you!\n\nFestival Pass tickets can be sele
 cted under any time slot!\n\n2:15 PM - 4:15 PM: Program 1\n\n5:00 PM - 6:4
 5 PM: Program 2\n\n8:00 PM - 10:00 PM: Program 3\n\n10:45 PM - 12:00...\n\
 nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.co
 m%2Fe%2Fthe-san-francisco-underground-short-film-festival-2026-tickets-200
 2970388350%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/202
 6/11/14/san-francisco-underground-short-film-festival-2026-first-program-t
 ickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34948646/365970c6-55cd-434a-aba5-725146d5ab46.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T214646Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/san-francisco-underground-short
 -film-festival-2026-first-program-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nirvanna the Band the Show Season Two
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T170000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17930749@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:"The Burger"\n\nMatt and Jay decide that this time\, they're s
 eeing their plan through. This time\, they're not giving up. This time\, t
 hey'll book a show at the Rivoli.\n\n"The Boost"\n\nMatt tries to win a sh
 ow at the Rivoli\, taking advantage of Jay's skills in the Nintendo 64 vid
 eo game Goldeneye 007 by entering him in the tournament\, but Jay runs int
 o some medical trouble.\n\n"The Buddy"\n\nJay leaves Matt home alone when 
 he heads out to a music industry party and befriends someone new\, but fam
 iliar. Together they come up with a plan to book a show at the Rivoli.\n\n
 "The Book"\n\nMatt goes out trick or treating on Halloween night\, while J
 ay discovers a cursed music book hidden in the house. The guys embark on a
  fun but terrifying quest\, working together to restore order.\n\nThis fil
 m can be used with loyalty cards or our 2026 annual CinemaSFBay passes\n\n
 "The B-Day"\n\nMatt forgets Jay's birthday and decides to get him a specia
 l gift. But after they get separated at a 4/20 rally\, they each go on a j
 ourney that forever changes their respective outlooks on life.\n\n"The Ban
 ned"\n\nMatt and Jay pose as hackers in an attempt to get onto the Rivoli'
 s band list\, but Matt has ulterior motives as they try to attack the Rivo
 li's mainframe with the help of a computer store employee.\n\n"The Band Li
 st"\n\nAs Matt and Jay continue to try and get on the Rivoli's Band List\,
  they infiltrate Toronto's intricate system of underground tunnels in the 
 hopes of entering the Rivoli from below.\n\n"The Banned List 2"\n\nAfter M
 a...\n\n$30\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20090?
 siteToken=52wkfzmjpwjjfpz3ye7tz8wscg\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/11/14/nirvanna-the-band-the-show-season-two-tickets\nSource: DoTheBa
 y
GEO:37.7760419;-122.498063
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34838663/163dfddc-8448-48c1-a89b-1c8d8b098f2b.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T210655Z
LOCATION:Balboa Theater\, 3630 Balboa St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/nirvanna-the-band-the-show-seas
 on-two-tickets
END:VEVENT
