  yet\, he is forced to bunk up with talkative Del Griffith (John Candy)\, 
 whom he finds extremely annoying. Together they must overcome the insanity
  of holiday travel to reach their intended destination.\n\nPresented on 35
 mm by Odyssey Film Institute. Dedicated to the exhibition of cinema on cel
 luloid film. Screenings\, Projection Workshops\, and Discussions. All exhi
