DESCRIPTION:In this jazzy gangster film\, reformed killer Tetsu’s attemp
 t to go straight is thwarted when his former cohorts call him back to Toky
 o to help battle a rival gang. Director Seijun Suzuki’s onslaught of sty
 lized violence and trippy colors is equal parts Russ Meyer\, Samuel Fuller
 \, and Nagisa Oshima—an anything-goes\, in-your-face rampage. Tokyo Drif
 ter is a delirious highlight of the brilliantly excessive Japanese cinema 
 of the sixties.\n\nThis film can be used with loyalty cards or our 2026 an
 nual CinemaSFBay passes\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/pur
 chase/20331?siteToken=52wkfzmjpwjjfpz3ye7tz8wscg\nDetails: https://dotheba
