BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dark Passage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T213000
DTSTAMP:20261029T100747Z
UID:dothebay-18006617@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Join WNP Film Club on November 22\, 2026 for a screening of a 
 San Francisco noir classic\, Dark Passage (1947).\n\nIn this atmospheric f
 ilm\, Humphrey Bogart stars as Vincent Parry\, a San Francisco man who esc
 apes prison after being wrongly convicted of murdering his wife. With the 
 help of a mysterious woman (Lauren Bacall)\, he attempts to clear his name
  while evading the police and searching for the real killer. Filmed on loc
 ation in San Francisco\, Dark Passage blends suspense\, romance\, and shad
 owy city streets into a classic noir thriller.\n\nWNP Film Club is a 4 Sta
 r Theater series brought to you by Western Neighborhoods Project\, your fr
 iendly community history nonprofit\, in partnership with Bay Area Movies (
 BAM) and Cinema SF Bay. Join us in celebrating movies filmed on location i
 n San Francisco\, with a connection to the west side. This screening will 
 feature an introduction by Jason Moore of BAM and WNP’s resident history
  nerd\, who will share some background about the film and featured locatio
 ns\, including “then and now” comparisons with support from Tim Welsh 
 of SF in Film. Optional Extra Credit: stick around after to unpack the mov
 ie with us and indulge your inner film nerd.\n\nThe program begins at 7:30
  PM on Sunday\, November 22. Tickets sales support the 4 Star Theater\, BA
 M and WNP!\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20275?s
 iteToken=d2atbcege5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/
 2026/11/22/dark-passage-tickets-rmzvvmd\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35182624/f63293a5-2bea-466a-b52d-8d5aee19da09.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T100747Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/22/dark-passage-tickets-rmzvvmd
END:VEVENT
