DESCRIPTION:The Crooked Jades\n\n(10th Album Release Show with Special Gue
 st Bruce Kaphan)\n\nA San Francisco original\, The Crooked Jades celebrate
  their 10th studio album release Beautiful World—a culmination of three 
 decades of music-making and surprising musical influences. Pioneers in bri
 nging old-time music to contemporary audiences\, The Crooked Jades continu
 e to evolve their unique sound by exploring the roots of Americana\, while
  pushing boundaries and blurring genres. Their fiery and soulful live perf
 ormances\, punctuated with eclectic vintage instrumentation\, are full of 
 unexpected sounds and are sure to get audiences on their feet.\n\nOur new 
 album Beautiful World is a musical adventure in time from the 1880's to th
 e1980's! In keeping with our reputation for our embracing diverse musical 
 influences this album presents some surprising genre-blending tracks. Alon
 g with the driving fiddle tunes and traditional ballads that we are known 
 for\, we reimagined songs culled from the soundtracks of our own lives tho
 ugh the lens of old time music. We can't wait to share this music alchemy 
 with you!\n\nThe core of The Crooked Jades are co-founders Jeff Kazor (voc
 als/guitar/ukulele)\, Lisa Berman (vocals / slide guitar / banjo / harmoni
 um)\, and Erik Pearson (vocals / banjos / ukulele / harmonium / slide guit
 ar.) The current line-up features two sensational new band members. On fid
 dle is the phenomenal Amy Kassir hailing from Durham\, North Carolina\, wh
 o recently released her solo fiddle tune album. On b...\n\nTickets: https:
 //ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20083?siteToken=d2atbcege5knqsavntt9
 1g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/4/live-music-the-croo
 ked-jades-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34838536/7f3e1c0e-b2d2-4735-9bb0-8c3dcc1088bb.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T210655Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/4/live-music-the-crooked-jades-tic
 kets
END:VEVENT
