DESCRIPTION:E. HayesEric Fraisher Hayes gives a lively\, fast-paced introd
 uction to playwright Eugene O’Neill\, his plays and the local treasure t
 hat is Tao House. Using images\, anecdotes and audience participation\, Er
 ic will cover the playwright’s life and work in less than an hour!\nEric
  Fraisher Hayes is the Eugene O’Neill Foundation Tao House Artistic Dire
 ctor. He has directed 36 of the playwright’s 51 plays and has a unique u
 nderstanding of the playwright and his work.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://s
