SUMMARY:Performance: Kim Shuck’s Poem Celebrates November Dance Shirt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T191500
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1633487@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:K. ShuckSan Francisco Poet Laureate emerita Kim Shuck\, poet L
 auren Ito and special guests celebrate Shuck’s new collection November D
 ance Shirt at SFPL’s Monthly poetry reading.\nKim Shuck was San Francisc
 o’s seventh Poet Laureate. Her poetry draws on her multiethnic backgroun
 d which includes Polish and Cherokee heritage\, and her experiences as a l
 ifelong resident of San Francisco. Her most recent book of poetry\, Novemb
 er Dance Shirt\, was published in 2026\, and her book of essays\, Noodle\,
  Rant\, Tangent\, was published in 2022. In her term as Poet Laureate\, sh
 e hosted scores of free poetry and art workshops for all ages at neighborh
 ood libraries and schools and worked closely with San Francisco Public Lib
 rary and the San Francisco Arts Commission to launch major citywide initia
 tives to honor Native American Indigenous Peoples’ heritage.\n\nFree\n\n
 Tickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/12/10/performance-kim-shucks-poem-ja
 m-celebrates-november-dance-shirt\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/perfor
 mance-kim-shucks-poem-celebrates-november-dance-shirt/\nSource: Funcheap S
 F
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Novemb
 er-Dance-Shirt-flyer-image.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Public Library\, Main Library\, Latino Room (lower 
 level)\, 100 Larkin Street\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/performance-kim-shucks-poem-celebrates-novembe
 r-dance-shirt/
