  and fundraiser benefiting the revived short-play festival.\n\nHosted by J
 ayme Catalano and Maryssa Wanlass\, the evening will feature original shor
 t plays\, live musical numbers from Bay Area favorites\, music direction a
 nd live accompaniment by Armando Fox\, a visit from Santa Claus\, and a sp
 ecial guest performance. Join us for an evening filled with theatre\, musi
 c\, warmth\, and a little seasonal mischief\, all in support of Shotz and 
 its next chapter.\n\n$31.66 - $45.55\nAmiosWest Presents\n\nTickets: https
 ://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%
