BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“Lift Every Voice” Free MLK Day Gospel/Blues Concert at SF’s
  Castro Theatre (2027)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T210000
DTSTAMP:20261008T185326Z
UID:funcheap-1641701@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Lift Every Voice 2027: Free MLK Day Singer Showcase (Castro Th
 eatre)San Francisco International Arts Festival presents Lift Every Voice:
  A Singer Showcase\, a free MLK Day concert at the Castro Theatre celebrat
 ing Black music traditions including gospel\, blues and jazz. The program 
 features the Dee Spencer Trio\, guest vocalist and MC Clairdee\, and 17 co
 mmunity singers\, with bassist Jewell McMillon and drummer Ruthie Price.\n
 Original Event Description:\nSFIAF Celebrates the MLK Bank Holiday with\nL
 ift Every Voice: A Singer Showcase\nat The Castro Theatre\nFeaturing The D
 ee Spencer Trio with Clairdee and 17 Community Singers\nCalendar Editors P
 lease Note\nWho: Dee Spencer Trio\, Clairdee & Community Singers\nWhat: Li
 ft Every Voice: A Singer Showcase\nWhere: Castro Theatre\n429 Castro St\, 
 San Francisco\, CA 94114\nDate:Monday January 18\, 7:00pm\nTickets: FREE\n
 Box Office and Information: https://www.sfiaf.org/2027_lift_every_voice or
  415-399-9554\n\nSan Francisco: San Francisco International Arts Festival 
 (SFIAF) is pleased to announce the 2027 rendition of Lift Every Voice: A S
 inger Showcase. This free to the public concert celebrates the Martin Luth
 er King\, Jr. Bank Holiday with Black music rooted in traditions such as g
 ospel\, blues and jazz. The program is designed to provide opportunities f
 or members of the community to engage with professional singers and musici
 ans in the exploration of Black/African American music. Featuring the Dee 
 Spencer Trio (led by Dr. Dee) with special guest vocalist...\n\nFree\n\nTi
 ckets: https://www.sfiaf.org/2027_lift_every_voice\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/lift-voice-free-mlk-day-gospelblues-concert-sfs-castro-theatre-
 2027/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lev_we
 bpage.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T185326Z
LOCATION:Castro Theatre\, 429 Castro St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lift-voice-free-mlk-day-gospelblues-concert-sf
 s-castro-theatre-2027/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
